to-be-incorporated-into-paper-156 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-156 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: A reading of a checked definition, or of `the T t`, is taken at its type: `quote` in" (cons "`lib/check.cub` reads the value as a code (`lib/code.cub`), applying a function to a fresh" (cons "variable of its domain, reading a pair by its projections and a path at a fresh dimension, and a" (cons "stuck elimination's branches at fresh fields typed by the constructor's telescope, at the motive." (cons "So `λ p → p 0` at `Path Nat zero zero → Nat` reads `λ x0 → zero`, and a variable of a Σ type" (cons "reads `(fst x0 , snd x0)`. Typed readings give full normal forms, except inside an" (cons "elimination written without a motive that is the head of a stuck term (applied, projected, or" (cons "eliminated), whose type is not known there; reached at a known type, its branches are read at that" (cons "type. A stuck word elimination carries no motive, so its branches are read without types: the" (cons "type `T = P w` it is quoted at does not determine an arbitrary motive `P`, so reading them at `T`" (cons "would be unsound (a motiveless case can be read at `T` because its motive is constant). The" (cons "code satisfies two laws: evaluating it (`eval-g`) gives a value" (cons "convertible with the original, and quoting that value gives the same code. A failure report" (cons "prints its types (expected and actual, a type that was eliminated) the same way." nil))))))))))))))
